    "The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "The development hereby permitted shall be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans and documents:&nbsp;<span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">ML140-03-1001A; ML140-03-1002B; ML140-03-1003D; ML140-03-1004;\r\nFlood Risk Assessment reference WTFR-FRA-2024/11/Q06 Rev C; Reasonable\r\nException Statement.</span>",
    "The materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the extension hereby permitted shall match those used in the existing building.",
